{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05401","headline":"奉和圣制中和节曲江宴百僚 · 李泌","name":"奉和圣制中和节曲江宴百僚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风俗时有变，中和节惟新。\n轩车双阙下，宴会曲江滨。\n金石何铿锵，簪缨亦纷纶。\n皇恩降自天，品物感知春。\n慈恩匝寰瀛，歌咏同君臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}